[22.497993, "o", "Night notes\r\n\r\nbind looked noisy when the vat directory came back in a different order.\r\nSomeone exported KETCH_ALPHA=1 so walkcue would line the paths up.\r\nSmoke still printed every finding. Desk citations still jumped on the next bind.\r\n"]
